    "scenario": "BGP Communities Local-AS",
    "goals": "• Configure AS {{confederation_as}} with the confederation sub-AS {{sub_as_a}} and AS {{sub_as_b}}.\n  AS {{external_as}}: {{router4_name}}\n  AS {{confederation_as}}: {{router1_name}}, {{router2_name}}, {{router3_name}}, {{router5_name}}\n  sub-AS {{sub_as_a}}: {{router2_name}}, {{router5_name}}\n  sub-AS {{sub_as_b}}: {{router1_name}}, {{router3_name}}\n• Configure EBGP between AS {{external_as}} and AS {{confederation_as}}.\n• Advertise the loopback0 interface on router {{router4_name}} in BGP.\n• Ensure network {{router4_loopback0_network}} /{{router4_loopback0_prefix_len}} only shows up in sub-AS {{sub_as_a}}. Use one of the communities to achieve this.",
